// The organic complement of 00 (same ruling): a fired CAPTURE
// consumed by an arm body fires the whole chain — per delivery, even
// with identical values (x delivers 1 then 1; the retained twin rt_a
// fires twice). The derivation-changed memo deliberately excludes
// captures from its key: their effect flows in-band through each
// param's disc, so the capture-consuming base arm fires while the
// capture-IGNORING const-body callee of the transient-rebind-init
// pin stays quiet. Under the pre-retention park/rebuild machinery the
// interp lost this fire entirely (the chain died at reconstruction
// holes — the aug13b rec-survivor class).
{let x = array::iter([i64:1, i64:1]); let rec f = |n: i64| -> i64 select n {v if v <= i64:0 => x, v => f(v - i64:1) + i64:1}; f(i64:2)}
